sentences.t:
πῶς δέ κεν Ἕκτωρ κῆρας ὑπεξέφυγεν θανάτοιο,
εἰ μή οἱ πύματόν τε καὶ ὕστατον ἤντετ’ Ἀπόλλων
ἐγγύθεν, ὅς οἱ ἐπῶρσε μένος λαιψηρά τε γοῦνα;

sentences.tr:
pōs de ken Hektōr kēras hypexephygen thanatoio,
ei mē hoi pymaton te kai hystaton ēntet’ Apollōn
engythen, hos hoi epōrse menos laipsēra te gouna;

sentences.l:
“Honoured one, truly many times father and lady mother
begged, in order, clasping my knees, and round about the companions,
to stay there; for such a one they all tremble beneath;

“Not any more you, son of Peleus, shall I fear, as before indeed
three times round the great town of Priam I fled, and never dared
to wait for you as you came on;

Not as I flee will you fix your spear in my back,
but straight on, to me eager, drive it through the chest,
if a god has granted you;
